{
  "slug": "carta-crm",
  "name": "Carta Crm",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Manage the Carta CRM conversationally — search, add, update, and enrich investors, companies, contacts, deals, notes, and fundraisings via the Carta CRM MCP Server.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **26 skills** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (26): `add-company` (Adds one or more company records to the Carta CRM via the Carta CRM MCP Server), `add-contact` (Adds one or more contact records to the Carta CRM via the Carta CRM MCP Server), `add-deal` (Creates one or more deal records in the Carta CRM via the Carta CRM MCP Server), `add-fundraising` (Adds one or more fundraising records to the Carta CRM via the Carta CRM MCP Server), `add-investor` (Adds one or more investor records to the Carta CRM via the Carta CRM MCP Server), `add-note` (Adds a note to a deal in the Carta CRM via the Carta CRM MCP Server; notes are…), `carta-crm-home-build` (Publishes the Carta CRM Home as a live artifact — a standalone page, at a stable URL, showing…), `deal-flow-analytics` (Aggregates recent deal flow in the Carta CRM into a dealmaker-facing report, auto-discovering which fields matter for this…), and 18 more\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `PostModelSwitch`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PreToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install carta-crm@claude-plugins-official` from `carta/plugins` (`plugins/carta-crm`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 26,
    "hook": 3
  },
